sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant M as Session model (workstation)
    participant D as Link daemon (workstation)
    participant L as Link entry (hub, session_link.py)
    participant A as Hub API (loopback, AGENT_TOKEN)
    participant P as Dashboard (person)

    M->>D: flow_check {kind, seats}
    D->>L: frame flow_check
    L->>L: validate fields, refuse extras
    L->>A: --flow-draft-check (no write)
    A-->>M: errors, warnings, graph
    M->>D: flow_draft_save
    D->>L: frame flow_draft_save
    L->>A: save under flow-drafts/<ws>/
    A-->>M: draft id
    P->>A: POST /api/flow-drafts/<ws>/<id>/promote
    A->>A: FlowStore.save (no builtin, no silent overwrite)
    M->>D: flow_run {project, flow, seats, params}
    D->>L: frame flow_run
    L->>A: POST /api/debates + started_by=session:<ws>
    A-->>M: job id (or 429 when slots are full)
    M->>D: flow_run_get {id, wait_sec}
    D->>L: frame flow_run_get
    L->>A: GET /api/debates/<id>
    A-->>M: status, decision (only if started_by matches)
    Note over A,P: Proposed actions wait in Approvals for a person (SD4)
